{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達恢復黃仁勳總裁兼行政總裁職務、並立即生效後，人工智能相關公司的股價大漲。英偉達股價一度上漲35%，創2000年以來最大盤中漲幅，短短數小時內市值增加逾1萬億美元，並帶動標普500指數和納斯達克100指數走高。漲勢還蔓延至晶片股，費城證券交易所半導體指數飆升13%；其他與人工智能基礎設施交易相關的股票也上漲，包括能源供應商和工業企業。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587698.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.045880+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:21:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_hash":"11691a4625dc5b5fecc4f2097ce2b136b2b3bbc61bfb0d4c0074c76adfdc4200","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}